0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20expectedBehavior%3A%20%27Both%20PDF%20parse%20entry%20points%20preserve%20the%20original%20file%20and%20expose%20Flate-%20and%20LZW-decoded%20content%20operators%20in%20linked%20documents%20with%20the%20encoded%20range.%20LZW%20supports%20both%20standard%20code-width%20transitions%20and%20chained%20ASCIIHex%20decoding.%20An%20option%20disables%20stream%20decoding%20and%20corrupt%20encoded%20data%20identifies%20the%20affected%20range.%20Declared%20page%20and%20form%20content%20keeps%20a%20decoded%20tree%20and%20encoded%20range%20when%20empty%20or%20containing%20only%20comments%20or%20inline%20images.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20selector%3A%20%27Flate%20and%20LZW%20page%20content%2C%20both%20binary%20input%20modes%2C%20disabled%20decoding%2C%20both%20LZW%20EarlyChange%20values%2C%20a%20chained%20filter%2C%20corrupt%20data%2C%20and%20declared%20page%20and%20form%20streams%20without%20text%20operators%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20assertions%3A%20%5B%27pdfDerivedOperatorsKeepEncodedRange%27%2C%20%27pdfFiltersCanBeDisabled%27%2C%20%27corruptPdfFilterKeepsLocatedError%27%2C%20%27pdfLzwCodeWidthsAndFilterChainsKeepEncodedRange%27%2C%20%27corruptPdfLzwKeepsLocatedError%27%2C%20%27pdfDeclaredContentWithoutTextKeepsEncodedRanges%27%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%7D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20id%3A%20%27I195-I239-PDF-FONT-UNICODE%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20construct%3A%20%27font%20Unicode%20mappings%20and%20decoded%20visible%20text%20in%20page%20order%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20expectedBehavior%3A%20%27The%20visible%20PDF%20projection%20follows%20the%20page%20tree%20and%20show-text%20operators%2C%20maps%20glyph%20codes%20through%20ToUnicode%20CMaps%20and%20simple-font%20encodings%2C%20and%20returns%20the%20covering%20original%20stream%20or%20literal%20source%20range.%20Explicitly%20positioned%20horizontal%20lines%20follow%20their%20page%20coordinates%20while%20retaining%20their%20original%20source%20ranges%2C%20including%20after%20page%20rotation%2C%20scoped%20graphics%20transforms%2C%20and%20nested%20form%20matrices.%20Tagged%20text%20follows%20marked-content%20order%20from%20the%20page%20structure%20tree%20while%20retaining%20the%20original%20stream%20or%20literal%20ranges.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20selector%3A%20%27reverse%20physical%20page%20order%2C%20an%20inherited%20Identity-H%20font%20with%20bfchar%20and%20bfrange%2C%20a%20WinAnsi%20Difference%2C%20horizontal%20text%20lines%20drawn%20out%20of%20reading%20order%2C%20scoped%20matrices%20across%20content%20streams%20and%20nested%20forms%2C%20inherited%20page%20rotation%2C%20and%20a%20structure%20tree%20with%20tagged%20page%20and%20form%20text%2C%20named%20properties%2C%20nested%20sequences%2C%20and%20an%20untagged%20footer%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20assertions%3A%20%5B%27pdfTextUsesFontMappingsAndPageOrder%27%2C%20%27pdfVisibleTextKeepsEncodedAndLiteralRanges%27%2C%20%27pdfPositionedLinesKeepReadingOrderAndRanges%27%2C%20%27pdfTransformedLinesKeepReadingOrderAndRanges%27%2C%20%27pdfTaggedSequencesKeepReadingOrderAndRanges%27%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%7D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20id%3A%20%27I195-I239-PDF-INHERITED-UNICODE-MAPS%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20construct%3A%20%27Unicode%20mappings%20and%20code%20spaces%20inherited%20from%20embedded%20character%20maps%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20expectedBehavior%3A%20%27Embedded%20UseCMap%20streams%20supply%20base%20glyph%20mappings%20and%20code%20spaces%20under%20the%20stream%20decoding%20policy%2C%20with%20nearer%20mappings%20taking%20precedence.%20The%20projection%20checks%20each%20byte%20against%20its%20corresponding%20code-space%20bounds%20and%20preserves%20the%20original%20operand%20range.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20selector%3A%20%27nested%20and%20Flate-compressed%20ToUnicode%20base%20maps%2C%20variable-width%20codes%20and%20per-byte%20ranges%2C%20and%20missing%20and%20circular%20base%20references%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%