URCES.openVocabularyMorphology%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20language%3A%20%27English%20morphology%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20version%3A%20%27Universal%20Dependencies%20v2%2C%20AGID%202016.01.19%20and%20WordNet%203.1%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20construct%3A%20%27dictionary%20readings%20and%20inverse%20inflection%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20expectedBehavior%3A%20%27English%20words%20receive%20scored%20attested%20readings%2C%20including%20ambiguous%20ones%2C%20at%20their%20exact%20source%20spans.%20Suffix%20predictions%20remain%20available%20outside%20the%20dictionary.%20Inflection%20and%20cardinal%20agreement%20select%20attested%20forms%20for%20the%20requested%20features.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20fixture%3A%20%27parity%2Ffixtures%2Fenglish-morphology.lino%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20selector%3A%20%27every%20English%20dictionary%2C%20function%20word%20and%20invented%20word%20reading%2C%20every%20linked%20span%20and%20alternative%2C%20and%20every%20inverse%20form%20and%20cardinal%20count%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20assertions%3A%20%5B%27englishDictionaryReadingsRetainAlternatives%27%2C%20%27englishMorphologyLinksRetainSourceSpans%27%2C%20%27englishInflectionAndNumberAgreement%27%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20implementationEntryPoints%3A%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20javascript%3A%20%5B%27js%2Fsrc%2Fmorphology.js%27%2C%20%27js%2Fsrc%2Fmorphology-english.js%27%2C%20%27js%2Ftests%2Fnatural-language-morphology.test.js%27%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20rust%3A%20%5B%27rust%2Fsrc%2Flink_network%2Fmorphology%2Fmod.rs%27%2C%20%27rust%2Fsrc%2Flink_network%2Fmorphology%2Fenglish.rs%27%2C%20%27rust%2Ftests%2Funit%2Fnatural_language_morphology.rs%27%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%7D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20id%3A%20%27I195-I240-JSON-SCHEMA%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20source%3A%20ISSUE_195_SOURCES.jsonSchema%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20language%3A%20%27JSON%20with%20draft%202020-12%20schemas%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20version%3A%20%27RFC%208259%20JSON%2C%20RFC%206901%20pointer%20and%20JSON%20Schema%20draft%202020-12%20semantics%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20construct%3A%20%27schema%20import%2C%20decoder%20grammar%20export%2C%20located%20validation%20and%20reverse%20inference%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20expectedBehavior%3A%20%27Import%20named%20and%20referenced%20schema%20constraints%20and%20emit%20interoperable%20decoder%20grammars.%20Lower%20exclusive%20alternatives%20with%20disjoint%20instance%20types%20exactly%20and%20report%20unsupported%20constraints.%20Match%20supported%20string%20patterns%20against%20decoded%20Unicode%20scalars%20regardless%20of%20their%20JSON%20escape%20spelling.%20Validation%20preserves%20syntax%20links%2C%20UTF-8%20spans%20and%20pointers%20at%20schema%20violations%20and%20malformed%20JSON.%20Emit%20the%20original%20schema%20or%20infer%20a%20schema%20from%20bounded%20finite%20productions.%20Date%2C%20date-time%2C%20UUID%20and%20email%20decoder%20rules%20recognize%20their%20supported%20formats%20across%20direct%20and%20escaped%20JSON%20spellings.%20A%20pattern%20surrogate-pair%20escape%20matches%20one%20Unicode%20scalar%2C%20including%20in%20character%20ranges%20and%20repetitions.%20Object%20constants%20and%20enumerated%20objects%20within%20the%20decoder%20member%20limit%20accept%20permutations%20with%20the%20same%20keys%20and%20values%2C%20including%20nested%20objects.%20Overlapping%20integer%20alternatives%20admit%20integer%20spellings%20that%20match%20exactly%20one%20interval%20and%20report%20alternate%20decimal%20and%20exponent%20spellings.%20Object%20alternatives%20are%20exact%20when%20disjoint%20allowed%20strings%20for%20a%20shared%20required%20property%20distinguish%20each%20pair%2C%20and%20retain%20diagnostics%20when%20optional%20or%20overlapping%20tags%20cannot%20distinguish%20the%20branches.%20Recognized%20string%20formats%20combine%20with%20supported%20regular%20patterns%20over%20decoded%20strings%2C%20with%20an%20impossible%20conjunction%20producing%20no%20generatable%20grammar.%20Finite%20local%20references%20and%20nested%20alternatives%20enforce%20supported%20sibling%20assertions%20and%20exclusive%20branch%20counts.%20Validation%20uses%20the%20original%20JSON%20number%20spelling%20for%20integer%20types%2C%20four%20numeric%20bounds%2C%20and%20numbers%20in%20constants%20and%20enumerations%2C%20with%20precise%20UTF-8%20spans.%20Sibling%20type%20assertions%20restrict%20references%20and%20alternatives%2C%20including%20recursive%20references%20and%20the%20integer%20subset%20of%20numbers.%20Exclusive%20branch%20tests%20apply%20inside%20the%20restricted%20types.%20Supported%20overlapping%20string%20alternatives%20count%20exactly%20one%20match%20across%20patterns%2C%20formats%20and%20finite%20values%2C%20including%20sibling%20string%20constraints.%20String-only%20local%20references%20and%20inclusive%20alternatives%20intersect%20supported%20sibling%20patterns%20and%20formats%20with%20referenced%20and%20branch%20languages%2C%20with%20diagnosed%20fallback%20at%20the%20established%20work%20bound.%20Bounded%20local%20reference%20chains%20enforce%20regular%20string%20constraints%20and%20participate%20in%20exact%20alternatives%20distinguished%20by%20string%20languages%20or%20required%20object%20tags.%20Numeric%20decoder%20limits%20compose%20through%20local%20reference%20chains%20and%20constrain%20numeric%20inclusive%20alternatives%20and%20exclusive%20integer%20intervals.%20Object-only%20reference%20chains%20combine%20required%20names%20with%20a%20single%20property%20layout%2C%20including%20its%20additional-property%20policy.%20Array-only%20chains%20take%20the%20strongest%20length%20bounds%20around%20a%20single%20item%20layout.%20Impossible%20combinations%20have%20no%20generatable%20collection%20and%20unsupported%20layout%20intersections%20report%20a%20validation%20diagnostic.%20With%20a%20single%20property%20or%20item%20layout%20per%20branch%2C%20sibling%20length%20bounds%20and%20required%20names%20apply%20to%20every%20inclusive%20branch%20and%20to%20exclusive%20branches%20with%20disjoint%20instance%20types%20or%20required%20tags.%20A%20closed%20array%20tail%20bounds%20the%20decoder%20by%20the%20prefix%20length%20in%20the%20same%20schema%20object%2C%20including%20an%20empty%20prefix%20and%20impossible%20positive%20minima%20across%20references%20and%20alternatives.%20Object%2C%20array%2C%20string%20and%20numeric%20sibling%20assertions%20also%20apply%20within%20their%20instance%20types%20in%20mixed-type%20or%20untyped%20local%20references%20and%20inclusive%20alternatives%2C%20and%20in%20exclusive%20alternatives%20with%20disjoint%20referenced%20instance%20types.%20Compatible%20object%20layouts%20combine%20declared%20fields%20and%20apply%20each%20additional-property%20schema%20only%20to%20names%20outside%20its%20own%20declarations.%20Compatible%20array%20layouts%20compose%20position%20by%20position%2C%20using%20each%20layer%5C%27s%20own%20prefix%20or%20tail%20schema.%20A%20forbidden%20item%20or%20disjoint%20declared%20types%20end%20the%20generatable%20prefix%20before%20the%20forbidden%20position.%20Additional-property%20defaults%20do%20not%20re-admit%20a%20declared%20property%20with%20disjoint%20types.%20Supported%20scalar%20assertions%20compose%20across%20property%20and%20item%20schemas%2C%20including%20local%20references%20to%20regular%20string%20constraints%20and%20inclusive%20numeric%20bounds.%20The%20same%20conjunction%20applies%20to%20additional%20property%20values%2C%20and%20type-scoped%20assertions%20permit%20unrelated%20instance%20types.%20When%20one%20property%20or%20item%20layer%20admits%20finitely%20many%20values%2C%20the%20decoder%20checks%20every%20candidate%20against%20all%20contributing%20schemas%2C%20including%20exclusive%20local%20alternatives%2C%20type-scoped%20numeric%20bounds%20and%20assertions%20on%20object%20members.%20An%20empty%20intersection%20forbids%20the%20property%20or%20item.%20Nested%20property%20and%20item%20collections%20combine%20compatible%20object%20and%20array%20layouts%20within%20a%20shared%20construction%20bound%2C%20with%20reported%20fallback%20on%20recursive%20intersections%20that%20reach%20the%20bound.%20Exclusive%20array%20alternatives%20with%20disjoint%20length%20intervals%20apply%20common%20sibling%20assertions%2C%20including%20intervals%20bounded%20by%20closed%20prefixes%20on%20local%20references.%20Overlapping%20length%20intervals%20with%20a%20shared%20item%20layout%20generate%20only%20lengths%20covered%20by%20exactly%20one%20branch.%20Unresolved%20intersections%20between%20different%20item%20layouts%20retain%20the%20exclusivity%20diagnostic.%20Exclusive%20array%20alternatives%20with%20overlapping%20lengths%20apply%20common%20sibling%20assertions%20when%20disjoint%20string%20sets%20distinguish%20a%20required%20position%20across%20local%20reference%20layers.%20An%20optional%20prefix%20cannot%20serve%20as%20that%20proof.%20Overlapping%20number-only%20alternatives%20apply%20joined%20limits%20and%20accept%20decimal%20spellings%20covered%20by%20exactly%20one%20branch%20across%20inclusive%20and%20open%20endpoints.%20When%20the%20exclusive%20intervals%20cover%20all%20numbers%2C%20exponent%20spellings%20remain%20generatable.%20Mixed%20integer%20and%20number%20alternatives%20count%20both%20kinds%20of%20branch%20for%20integral%20values%2C%20including%20zero-padded%20decimal%20spellings%2C%20and%20count%20only%20number%20branches%20for%20non-integral%20values.%20Supported%20string%20and%20numeric%20exclusivity%20applies%20independently%20within%20their%20instance%20types%20when%20other%20JSON%20instance%20types%20have%20separate%20alternatives.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20fixture%3A%20%27parity%2Ffixtures%2Fjson-schema-and-recovery.lino%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20selector%3A%20%27answer%20schema%2C%20closed%20records%2C%20tuple%20bounds%2C%20local%20references%2C%20formats%2C%20integer%20ranges%2C%20finite%20and%20disjoint%20exclusive%20alternatives%2C%20unsupported%20keywords%2C%20malformed%20answers%2C%20inferred%20constants%2C%20anchored%20and%20unanchored%20patterns%20with%20raw%20and%20escaped%20Unicode%2C%20four%20formats%20with%20direct%20and%20escaped%20JSON%20spellings%2C%20regular%20expression%20surrogate%20pairs%20in%20ranges%20and%20repetitions%20alongside%20escaped%20backslash%20controls%2C%20and%20reordered%20objects%20in%20constants%20and%20enumerations%20alongside%20changed-key%20and%20changed-value%20controls%2C%20and%20overlapping%20inclusive%2C%20exclusive%20and%20unbounded%20integer%20intervals%20with%20equivalent%20numeric%20spellings%2C%20and%20object%20alternatives%20with%20required%20and%20optional%20discriminating%20properties%2C%20and%20intersections%20of%20calendar%2C%20time%20zone%2C%20UUID%20and%20email%20formats%20with%20regular%20patterns%20and%20impossible%2C%20escaped%20and%20nullable-choice%20controls%2C%20alongside%20finite%20references%20with%20restrictive%20siblings%20and%20nested%20exclusive%20alternatives%20with%20shared%20values%2C%20and%20standalone%20and%20nested%20decimal%20equality%2C%20bounds%2C%20underflow%2C%20negative%20zero%20and%20integer%20semantics%20near%20host%20rounding%20boundaries%2C%20and%20differently%20typed%20references%20to%20the%20same%20schema%2C%20recursive%20members%2C%20unrestricted%20and%20finite%20branches%2C%20exclusive%20alternatives%20and%20impossible%20type%20intersections%2C%20and%20overlapping%20regular%20string%20branches%20with%20sibling%20formats%2C%20finite%20values%2C%20escaped%20equivalents%20and%20empty%20exclusive%20languages%2C%20and%20sibling%20assertions%20on%20local%20string%20references%20and%20inclusive%20choices%2C%20unrestricted%20exclusive%20branches%2C%20empty%20intersections%20and%20bounded%20residual%20validation%2C%20and%20local%20reference%20chains%20with%20sibling%20string%20constraints%20and%20disjoint%20or%20overlapping%20required%20string%20tags%2C%20plus%20stricter%20linked%20integer%20and%20decimal%20bounds%2C%20numeric%20union%20and%20exclusive%20interval%20overlap%2C%20empty%20intersections%20and%20spellings%20reserved%20for%20validation%2C%20and%20array%20length%20and%20required%20object%20properties%20on%20local%20reference%20chains%20with%20closed%2C%20typed-open%2C%20and%20conflicting-constraint%20controls%2C%20and%20common%20collection%20bounds%20or%20required%20fields%20across%20inclusive%20and%20disjoint%20exclusive%20alternatives%2C%20plus%20closed%20tails%20next%20to%20array%20references%20and%20alternatives%20with%20incompatible%20prefix%20schemas%20and%20impossible%20lower%20bounds%2C%20followed%20by%20mixed-type%20and%20undeclared-type%20reference%20and%20alternative%20constraints%20with%20accepted%20unrelated%20types%2C%20plus%20combined%20object%20layouts%20with%20duplicate%20and%20disjoint%20declarations%2C%20local%20typed%20and%20closed%20additional%20properties%2C%20impossible%20required%20names%20and%20diagnosed%20incompatible%20constraints%2C%20followed%20by%20compatible%20array%20positions%20and%20tails%2C%20impossible%20reachable%20positions%2C%20unreachable%20conflicting%20schemas%20and%20disjoint%20property%20types%2C%20followed%20by%20shared%20property%20and%20item%20regular%20patterns%2C%20linked%20scalar%20constraints%2C%20additional%20property%20values%2C%20untyped%20scalar%20assertions%2C%20bounded%20tails%20and%20alternative%20residuals%2C%20followed%20by%20finite%20Boolean%2C%20numeric%20and%20object%20values%2C%20overlapping%20exclusive%20branches%2C%20escaped%20names%20and%20values%2C%20and%20a%20prohibited%20required%20property%2C%20plus%20arrays%20of%20intersected%20object%20layouts%2C%20object%20properties%20with%20intersected%20array%20layouts%2C%20an%20impossible%20required%20nested%20array%2C%20and%20bounded%20recursive%20fallback%2C%20then%20linked%20exclusive%20arrays%20with%20disjoint%20lengths%20and%20an%20independent%20null%20branch%2C%20plus%20overlapping%20length%20intervals%20with%20shared%20items%20and%20document%20validation%20controls%20for%20different%20item%20layouts%2C%20followed%20by%20overlapping%20lengths%20with%20disjoint%20required%20prefix%20strings%20and%20an%20optional-prefix%20overlap%20control%2C%20then%20linked%20overlapping%20decimal%20intervals%20with%20inclusive%20and%20open%20endpoints%2C%20negative%20zero%2C%20singleton%20and%20full-range%20exponent%20controls%2C%20and%20an%20impossible%20duplicate%20interval%2C%20then%20mixed%20linked%20and%20unbounded%20numeric%20alternatives%20with%20integral%20decimal%20spellings%2C%20non-integral%20values%2C%20signed%20zero%20and%20an%20impossible%20mixed%20interval%2C%20then%20projected%20exclusive%20alternatives%20across%20string%2C%20number%2C%20Boolean%20and%20null%20instance%20types%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20assertions%3A%20%5B%27decoderGrammarsConstrainSchema%27%2C%20%27schemaDiagnosticsRetainSyntaxLinks%27%2C%20%27grammarAndSchemaRoundTrip%27%2C%20%27decoderDisjointExclusiveBranchesHaveNoResidual%27%2C%20%27decoderPatternsRespectDecodedStrings%27%2C%20%27decoderFormatsRespectDecodedStrings%27%2C%20%27decoderPatternsCombineEscapedSurrogatePairs%27%2C%20%27decoderObjectConstantsAcceptMemberPermutations%27%2C%20%27decoderExclusiveIntegerAlternativesRejectOverlap%27%2C%20%27decoderRequiredStringTagsDistinguishAlternatives%27%2C%20%27decoderFormatsCombineWithRegularPatterns%27%2C%20%27decoderChecksFiniteReferencedAlternatives%27%2C%20%27validationUsesExactNumericSpellings%27%2C%20%27decoderAppliesSiblingTypeAssertions%27%2C%20%27decoderSelectsExclusiveRegularStrings%27%2C%20%27decoderIntersectsSiblingRegularStrings%27%2C%20%27decoderResolvesLinkedAlternatives%27%2C%20%27decoderCombinesLinkedNumericBounds%27%2C%20%27decoderCombinesLinkedCollectionAssertions%27%2C%20%27decoderAppliesSiblingCollectionAssertionsToAlternatives%27%2C%20%27decoderBoundsClosedArrayTailsByTheirOwnPrefix%27%2C%20%27decoderAppliesLinkedAssertionsWithinInstanceTypes%27%2C%20%27decoderCombinesCompatibleObjectPropertyLayouts%27%2C%20%27decoderCombinesCompatibleArrayItemLayouts%27%2C%20%27decoderIntersectsScalarPropertyAndItemAssertions%27%2C%20%27decoderFiltersFiniteProper